            8 ≤ ↑G ∧
              n + 2 * harbor n p + 100 * ℓ ≤ ↑D ∧
                E = clouds D ∧
                  J * (clouds D * (2 * R + 3)) ≤ Real.exp (-2 * (rentL D + J)) ∧
