              ‖F'‖ ≤ C ∧ ‖V'‖ ≤ C ∧ ‖F'ᴴ * V' - 1‖ ≤ δ ∧ ‖(1 - tip N M) * V'‖ ≤ η) →
        TideFrame n p X Z D w δ η C
