info: VerifiedSatinNovember4Updates.lean:63:0: @YM.CF.Py.Rate.LocalLimit.Rundle.theta_upper : ∀ {Λ : YM.CF.Py.Rate.LocalLimit.Preparation} {l' : ℕ}
